{
  "id": "DEU.21",
  "number": "21",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Ŋuɔ̱T 21",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t kɛ kui̱ raam mi ca luc",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi ca raan jek piny a cɛ li̱w muun in käm Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu ɛ ji̱, kä kueckɛ ram in näk jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ bööthkun kɛnɛ kua̱r luɔ̱kdun wä gua̱a̱th in cɛ li̱w thi̱n, thɛm kamdɛ kɛnɛ wi̱i̱ tin thieek kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ bööth wec in thia̱k kɛ ram in ci li̱w ka̱nkɛ ruath mi /ka̱n la̱a̱t kä /ka̱n moc gäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn bööth wec ɛmɔ akɛ nööŋkɛ ruath wi̱i̱ lo̱o̱lä mi löny pi̱kɛ, mi /ka̱n mät pur kä /ka̱n mät pith, kä ba ŋuäk ruaath töl rɛy lo̱o̱lä nɔmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi bööth palä ben kä gaat Lii-bay tin ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ mɛk i̱ ba ruacdɛ lat, kä ba puɔ̱th lat kɛ ciötdɛ, kä bikɛ ti diaal cu lat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi bööth wec diaal in thieek kɛ ram in ci li̱w tetkiɛn la̱th jɔk ruaath in ca ŋuäkdɛ töl wi̱i̱ lo̱o̱lä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ cu lɛk i̱, ‘/Ken nɛy ɛ näk ɛn ram ɛ mi, kä /ken nɛy ɛ nɛn ɛn ram in ci jɛ näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Päli nɛɛku ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl tëë ci kän lätikä, lö Kuoth Nhial, kä /cu nɛɛku ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl moc duer kɛ kui̱ lieth raam mi thil duerɛ. Ku kɛ pa̱l dueriɛn.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, bia duer riɛm raam mi can cu woc rɛydun, mi wä yɛn mi gɔaa la̱t waaŋ Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t kɛ kui̱ mään ti ca pɛc ko̱o̱r",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi wiaa wä ko̱o̱r kä ji̱ tɛ̈run. Kä bi Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun kɛ ka̱m yɛ, ɛ bia kɛ pɛc, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä bi ciek mi gɔaa nɛn rɛydiɛn, kä biɛ bëc rɔ ala ciek, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naŋ ni jɛ dhɔru, a jɛ muut wi̱cdɛ kä a jɛ ŋuk riöpkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Muɔ̱t wec kɛnɛ ŋukni rio̱pni lotdɛ ni ɣöö ca raan woc kuaanyä kä cɛ rɔ mat rɛy buɔ̱m ji̱ wec.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A jɛ woc bieyni tëë pɛ̈ɛ̈ckɛ ni jɛ, dhɔru a jɛ paar gua̱n kɛnɛ man kɛ pay kɛɛliw. Kɛ kɔrɛ biɛ cu ka̱n ala ciekdu, kä bi cua̱ cɔwdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ci jɛ go̱o̱r, jak ni jɛ kä wä guäth ɔ go̱o̱rɛ mɔ. Duundɛ ɣöö cu jɛ kɔk kɛ yio̱w, kä cu jɛ ciɛŋ ala kuany, min ci jɛ ka̱n kɛ buɔ̱m.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t kɛ kui̱c gatdä min kɛ̈ɛ̈",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi te raan kɛ män da̱ŋ rɛw, nhɔkɛ kɛl kä lökɛ min dɔ̱ŋ, kä ca jɛ da̱p gaat ɛ kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw, kä gat in kɛ̈ɛ̈ ɛ gat ciek in lökɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cäŋ in wee nyinkɛ wä go̱ri bɛ kɛ dääk kä gaatkɛ, a /ci gat ciek in nhɔkɛ ciɛŋ ala kɛ̈ɛ̈ kä gat ciek in lökɛ, min la kɛ̈ɛ̈, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a jɛ ŋäc kɛ̈ɛ̈, ala gat ciek in lökɛ, a jɛ kämɛ kui̱c in di̱t ni jɛn kä nyinkɛ diaal, ɛ jɛn buɔ̱mdɛ in nhiam. Cuŋ këëkä kɛ nyinkɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t kɛ kui̱ gatdä mi jiääk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi te raan kɛ gat mi bum wi̱cdɛ mi ci gua̱n kɛn man liŋ, a cäŋ dua̱ckɛ jɛ bä, ŋotdɛ /cɛ kɛ liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ gua̱n kɛnɛ man jɛ nöŋ bööth wecdiɛn thok rɛɛk, guäth luɔ̱k, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akɛ jiökɛ bööth wecdiɛn i̱, ‘Gatda nɛmɛ bum wi̱cdɛ kä lätdɛ jiäk, /cɛ ruacda liŋ. Ŋarɛ ŋɔak ŋar kä ɛ yɔ̱ŋ kɔaŋ’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba cu bök kɛ dööl ɛ wutni wec diaal mäni mi cɛ li̱w. Inɔ bia jiäk cu woc rɛydun, kä bi ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ɛ liŋ kä bikɛ cu dual.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t tin kɔ̱kiɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi ci raan duer mi dëë jɛ näk la̱t, ɛ ca näk, kɛ ŋa̱pdɛ wi̱i̱ jiaath, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a puɔ̱nydɛ /ci wäär thuk wi̱i̱ jiaath, kuɔ̱nyɛ jɛ niɛ cäŋ ɛ mɔ, kɛ ɣöö ram mi ca ŋap, ca kuɛth ɛ Kuoth /cuarɛ mundun in ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun ɛ ka̱m yɛ i̱ bia ciɛŋ yär.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
